@{
    Layout = null;
}
@*
    The offline notice — the one page the service worker keeps on the device.

    Layout = null, and that is the point of the file rather than a shortcut. The panel's shell is
    rendered for whoever asked: it carries their email, their capacity card, their antiforgery token
    and the nav items their claims allow. None of that may be written to a phone's disk, and a page
    that inherited the shell would be one `@@if` away from carrying it. This draws the public page's
    chrome-less frame instead, out of the same stylesheet, and holds nothing that varies by reader.

    No island either. The theme control is Vue, and this page may be shown with no network at all —
    the bundle is normally in the worker's cache and normally loads, but "normally" is not a thing to
    hang a control on. Everything here is server-rendered and works with no script at all.
*@
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html dir="@PanelCulture.Direction" lang="@PanelCulture.Code" data-theme="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>@UiText.Brand.PageTitle(UiText.Offline.Title)</title>
    <partial name="_HeadAssets" />
</head>
<body>
<div class="public-page">
    <div class="public-wrap">
        <header class="public-head">
            <div class="row">
                <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">@UiText.Brand.Mark</span>
                <span class="brand-name">@UiText.Brand.Name</span>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="card card--pad">
            <h1 class="page-title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">@UiText.Offline.Title</h1>
            <p class="page-sub" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">@UiText.Offline.Body</p>

            @* role="status" because this page arrives without anybody navigating to it by name:
               the address bar still says /files, and a reader who cannot see the screen is
               otherwise told nothing about why that is not what loaded. *@
            <p class="notice" role="status" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">@UiText.Offline.NothingStored</p>

            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/">@UiText.Offline.Retry</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
